# Conversations

== dialogue_open ==
[hello_named]
Yes?
What can I do for you?       {polite}
What is it?                  {!polite}
What do you want?            {rude}
Hm?                          {introvert}
Oh! Hi! What's up?           {extrovert+}
Mm.                          {taciturn}
Talk fast.                   {opinion=disliked}
What now?                    {opinion=disliked, rude}
Hey, [listener]. What's on your mind? {opinion=friend}
[listener]! Always good to see you. {opinion=close_friend}
Not now... I'm still sore all over. {recovering=yes}
Make it quick, I've got work to do. {hardworking}
Oh, thank the Cube. A break.  {lazy, pious}
Oh, thank goodness. A break.  {lazy}
Yes, [kin_call]?             {age=adult, listener_kin=parent, w=6}
What's up?                   {listener_kin=sibling, w=5}
Yes, dear?                   {listener_kin=spouse, w=6}
What is it, love?            {listener_kin=spouse, w=5}

== smalltalk ==
Another year older. Feels about the same. {birthday=yes, w=6}
It's my birthday! Did you get me anything? {birthday=yes, greedy, w=10}
It's my birthday! Did you get me anything? {birthday=yes, lighthearted, w=6}
Birthdays make me think about all the years gone by. {birthday=yes, sentimental, w=10}
Another year closer to the end. Happy birthday to me. {birthday=yes, pessimist, w=10}
Not much to say, really.
Same as always.
Keeping busy.                {hardworking}
Trying not to get too busy.  {lazy}
I've been thinking about [favorite_food.s] all day. {glutton, w=2}
You know what I could go for? [favorite_food.a.cap]. {glutton}
I'd kill for [favorite_food.a] right now. {glutton, crude}
Some folks like [hated_food.s]. I don't get it. {w=0.6}
If anyone offers you [hated_food.a], say no. Trust me. {w=0.6}
[favorite_food.cap] [favorite_food.is] the best thing there is. Fight me. {lighthearted, w=0.6}
Have you heard anything interesting? {nosy, w=2}
So, who've you been talking to? {nosy}
What's out there, past the hills? {curious, w=2}
Seen anything strange on your travels? {curious}
The Cube God watches over us all. {pious, w=2}
Say your prayers to the Cube God tonight. {pious, time=evening}
I've been keeping score, you know. I'm winning. {competitive}
Whatever you're good at, I'm probably better. No offense. {competitive, lighthearted}
Someone here thinks they work harder than me. They're wrong. {competitive, hardworking}
I don't lose. I occasionally fail to win. {competitive, proud}
I don't like to brag, but I'm the best around here. {proud}
Oh, I'm nobody special.      {humble}
Everything's going to be fine. I can feel it. {optimist}
Something bad is coming. I can feel it. {pessimist}
Honestly? Could be worse.    {pessimist}
Isn't it a fine day?         {optimist, weather=clear, time=day}
This rain is getting into my bones. {weather=rain, pessimist}
I like the rain, honestly.   {weather=rain, weather_like=like}
I love the rain. Everything smells new. {weather=rain, weather_like=love, w=2}
I could stand out in this rain all day. {weather=rain, weather_like=love, lighthearted}
I hate the rain. Everything's damp. Me especially. {weather=rain, weather_like=hate, w=2}
This rain had better stop soon. {weather=rain, weather_like=dislike}
I love a good storm. Makes you feel alive. {weather=storm, weather_like=love, w=2}
I'm not scared of storms. I just don't like them. At all. {weather=storm, weather_like=hate, timid, w=2}
Storms make me nervous.      {weather=storm, weather_like=dislike}
The Cube God is angry today. {weather=storm, pious}
Snow makes everything quiet. I like that. {weather=snow, weather_like=love, introvert}
I love the snow!             {weather=snow, weather_like=love}
Snow. Cold, wet, and everywhere. {weather=snow, weather_like=hate}
Fog like this, anything could be out there. {weather=fog, paranoid, w=2}
I like the fog. Nobody bothers you. {weather=fog, weather_like=love}
Can't see my own hands in this fog. {weather=fog, weather_like=dislike}
Red rain. That's an omen if ever I saw one. {weather=blood_rain, pious, w=2}
Is the rain... red? Why is the rain red? {weather=blood_rain}
Blood from the sky. Wonderful. Just wonderful. {weather=blood_rain, pessimist}
Honestly, I think the red rain is kind of pretty. {weather=blood_rain, weather_like=like}
Not a cloud in the sky. Perfect. {weather=clear, weather_like=love, time=day}
Too bright out. I miss the clouds. {weather=clear, weather_like=hate, time=day}
My favorite weather? [favorite_weather.s.cap]. No contest. {w=0.6}
Give me [favorite_weather.s] any day. {w=0.6}
I can't stand [hated_weather.s].  {w=0.5}
I love [season_word]. Best time of the year. {season_like=love, w=1.5}
[season_word.cap] again. I'll live. {season_like=dislike}
I can't wait for [favorite_season]. {!season_like=love, w=0.6}
Every [season_word] I tell myself I'll get used to it. I never do. {season_like=hate}
[season_word.cap] is for harvests. And eating them. {season=fall, glutton}
Spring makes everyone fall in love. Have you noticed? {season=spring, romantic}
Fall always makes me think of the old days. {season=fall, sentimental}
Winter nights are the best nights. So long. {season=winter, night_owl}
Long summer days. More time to work. {season=summer, hardworking}
Summer means naps in the shade. {season=summer, lazy}
I love it out here in [biome_word.the]. {biome_like=love, w=1.5}
[biome_word.the.cap] suits me. {biome_like=like}
I'll never get used to [biome_word.the]. {biome_like=hate}
Some days I wish I lived somewhere other than [biome_word.the]. {biome_like=dislike}
If I could live anywhere, it'd be [favorite_biome.the]. {w=0.6}
You'll never catch me in [hated_biome.the]. Never. {w=0.5}
Have you ever been to [favorite_biome.the]? You should. {extrovert, w=0.5}
I've always wanted to see [hated_biome.the]. Just to know. {curious, w=0.6}
I've got a thing for [favorite_thing.s], you know. {w=0.8}
If you ever find [favorite_thing.a], think of me. {w=0.7}
I love [favorite_thing.s]. Don't ask me why. {w=0.6}
Nobody believes me, but I love [favorite_thing.s]. {surprising_thing=yes}
Don't ever give me [hated_thing]. I mean it. {w=0.6}
Want to know what I hate? [hated_thing.cap]. {w=0.5}
I could look at [favorite_thing.s] all day. {curious}
A person can never have too many [favorite_thing.s]. {greedy}
I love animals. All of them. Even the ones that bite. {animal_lover, w=2}
Be gentle with the animals, would you? {animal_lover}
People who hurt animals... I don't trust them. {animal_lover, serious}
If I could, I'd live in [favorite_biome.the]. I love the smell of it. {w=0.3}
I've had a rough time lately. {mood=bad}
[partner] and I are doing well, thanks for asking. Well, you didn't ask. {relationship=married, to_partner=no, w=1.5}
Married life suits me.       {relationship=married, optimist, w=1.5}
Married life is... an adjustment. {relationship=married, to_partner=no, pessimist, w=1.5}
I can't stop thinking about [partner]. {relationship=dating, to_partner=no, romantic, w=3}
[partner] and I have been seeing each other. Don't tell anyone. {relationship=dating, to_partner=no, w=1.5}
I'm getting married! Did you hear? {relationship=engaged, to_partner=no, w=2.5}
Wedding plans. So many wedding plans. {relationship=engaged, hardworking, w=2}
I still set two plates out, some nights. {relationship=widowed, sentimental, w=2}
I miss them every day.       {relationship=widowed, w=1}
It's lonely, some nights.    {relationship=widowed, w=1.5}
Being single's fine. Really. {relationship=single, pessimist, w=0.5}
Haven't had [taught_food.a] in days. {w=1.5}
I could really go for [taught_food.a] right now. {glutton, w=3}
I saw [taught_animal.a] by the river yesterday! {w=1.5}
Do you think [taught_animal.s] bite? {timid, w=2}
Lost my [taught_thing] again. {w=1.5}
Can't find my [taught_thing] anywhere. Have you seen it? {w=1}
Ever been to [taught_place]? {w=1.5}
I'd love to see [taught_place] one day. {curious, w=2}
Isn't this weather just [taught_describe]? {weather=clear, w=1.5}
You know what you are? [taught_describe.cap]. {opinion=friend, w=1.5}
Been [taught_activity] lately? {w=1.5}
I spent all morning [taught_activity]. Best morning in ages. {w=1}
Kids. They grow up so fast.  {relationship=married, w=0.5}
I'd like to meet someone special one day. {relationship=single, romantic, w=2}
You and me, [listener]. Always. {listener_kin=spouse, w=4}
I love you, you know.        {listener_kin=spouse, romantic, w=4}
I love you, you know.        {listener_kin=partner, romantic, w=3}
I was hoping you'd come by.  {listener_kin=partner, w=3}
Can't wait to marry you.     {listener_kin=fiance, w=4}
Not great. Let's leave it there. {mood=awful}
I feel wonderful today!      {mood=great}
Life's good.                 {mood=good}
Still recovering. Don't make me laugh, it hurts. {recovering=yes}
I'm still sore from that beating. {recovering=yes}
The [enemy_faction] are trouble. Watch yourself. {has_enemy=yes}
If you see any of the [enemy_faction], run. {has_enemy=yes, timid}
If you see any of the [enemy_faction], send them my way. {has_enemy=yes, brave}
Being one of the [faction] is all right. {has_faction=yes}
You and me, we make a good team. {opinion=friend, leader=yes}
I'm glad we're friends, [listener]. {opinion=close_friend}
You again.                   {opinion=disliked}
Why are you talking to me?   {opinion=disliked, rude}
I hear the [enemy_faction] eat [hated_food.s]. Disgusting. {has_enemy=yes, lighthearted, w=0.5}
Late, isn't it? I like the night. {night_owl, time=night}
I should be in bed.          {early_bird, time=night}
Up with the sun, that's me.  {early_bird, time=morning}
Know any good jokes? I know a terrible one. {lighthearted}
Let's keep this short.       {introvert}
So much to talk about, where do I even start? {chatterbox}
Hm.                          {taciturn}
Did you see that? No? Never mind. {paranoid}
They're watching us, you know. {paranoid}
I met a talking sheep once. Honest. {liar}
I'd never lie to you.        {honest}
You look good today. Really. {romantic}
Do you ever think about settling down? {romantic}
You raised me well, you know. {age=adult, listener_kin=parent, sentimental, w=8}
Don't worry about me, [kin_call]. I'm fine. {age=adult, listener_kin=parent, w=8}
Are you looking after yourself, [kin_call]? {age=adult, listener_kin=parent, w=6}
Remember when I was little? Feels like forever ago. {age=adult, listener_kin=parent, w=6}
What should we have for dinner? {listener_kin=spouse, w=6}
The house feels empty when you're out. {listener_kin=spouse, w=5}
Don't stay out too late, love. {listener_kin=spouse, w=5}
Remember when we used to fight over everything? We still do. {listener_kin=sibling, w=6}
You were always the favorite. {listener_kin=sibling, jealous, w=8}

